    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ZalithLauncher/ZalithLauncher2/tarball/2.6.1",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ZalithLauncher/ZalithLauncher2/zipball/2.6.1",
    "body": "## Updates:\r\n- #1950: Added onboarding guide to launcher main interface & control layout editor (by @MovTery)\r\n- #1956: Refactored existing easter egg effect layer, added easter egg effects for multiple holidays (by @MovTery)\r\n- #1957: Added compatibility with lwjgl3ify & use MioLauncherWrapper (by @MovTery)\r\n- #1963: Card grid supports free placement, allowing vertical gaps between cards (by @MovTery)\r\n\r\n## Refactors:\r\n- #1972: Optimized main interface card repositioning logic, card drag displacement changed to chain-style door-opening semantics (by @MovTery)\r\n- #1974: Refactored tablet main interface layout (by @MovTery)\r\n\r\n## Changes:\r\n- #1973: Adjusted launcher update dialog style (by @MovTery)\r\n\r\n## Fixes:\r\n- #1964: SDL message box message mistakenly set as title causing incomplete error info display (by @MovTery)\r\n- #1971: Fixed Cleanroom input method input being misidentified as key presses (by @MovTery)",
